          "min_libbridgething_version": "0.16.0",
          "changelog": "Easier to reach. The controls now keep well clear of the dial: with the dial at the bottom they sit higher on the\nscreen, with open space where the knob is, and with the dial at the top they sit lower. Skip buttons are bigger.\nSwipe the album art left for the next song or right for the previous one; a tap still opens lyrics. The\n\"Now playing\" header is gone to make room, and lyrics moved to a button next to the heart."
        },
