          "min_libbridgething_version": "0.16.0",
          "changelog": "The screen now turns off when your Mac goes fully to sleep, like closing the lid with a monitor still powering the\nCar Thing. A sleeping Mac goes silent instead of disconnecting, so the desktop add-on now checks in every 5 seconds\nand Portrait goes dark after 20 seconds without hearing from it, then wakes with the Mac. A song left \"playing\" when\nthe Mac slept no longer keeps the screen on either: once it should have ended, it counts as paused."
        },
